- Likely Cause: Model issue—the lack of a global constraint enforcing EmergencyPrivilege revocation causes downstream assertions to fail.
- Smallest fix: As above, enforce EmergencyPrivilege revocation globally; also, ensure that delegations not assigned during Emergency persist correctly after Emergency mode, possibly by moving the logic for revocation out of the requirement predicates into a global fact.

